# Bloodline Bidding returns "all creature cards of the chosen type": a card of that type that is no creature card stays. Bot2's
# Duress takes Boggart Mischief (a Kindred Enchantment - Goblin) from Bot1's hand on turn 4 and Bolts Bot1's Bile-Vial Boggart and
# an Ornithopter on turn 2. On turn 7 Bot1 casts Bloodline Bidding with Black Lotus ({B}{B}{B}), its three Moxen and two
# creatures convoked, and chooses Goblin: the Boggart returns, the Goblin enchantment card and the Ornithopter stay.

